<title>NEW ZEALAND: PDL sees NZ$12.4 mln 1997 post-tax profit.</title>
<headline>PDL sees NZ$12.4 mln 1997 post-tax profit.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>PDL Holdings Ltd on Tuesday forecast a post-tax full year profit to March 1997 of NZ$12.4 million, up 22 percent on 1996.</p>
<p>At its annual meeting in Christchurch, PDL said revenue in the five months to August 31 had risen 13 percent to $144 million.</p>
</text>
